tention, calmness. Also note C's communication difficulty and egocentric, but perhaps still outweigh D's concerns? We need to decide. Likely shift to C.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Anna, shift vote to C, explain that D's lack of crew cooperation evidence and negative descriptors outweigh his technical strengths, while C's cooperative attitude and decision quality make him better overall despite communication issues. Provide explicit facts: D is know-it-all, hot temper, loner; C puts concern for others above everything, can make correct decisions quickly, excellent attention. Conclude vote C.\n\nProceed."}
